OL,3,AFormer Scotland rugby international to
OL,4,Ago on trial charged with rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Scotland rugby international
OL,7,Fis to go on trial accused of
OL,8,Fcontrolling, abusing and raping a
OL,9,Fwoman.
OL,11,FThe charges against Tim Visser span a
OL,12,F14-year period and are alleged to have
OL,13,Fhappened in Edinburgh and elsewhere
OL,14,Fbetween 2010 and 2024.
OL,16,FTwo of the four charges state that the
OL,17,F39 year-old, who has been capped 33
OL,18,Ftimes by Scotland, raped the woman on
OL,19,Fvarious occasions.
OL,21,FThese include claims he had sex with
OL,22,Fher after consent had been withdrawn.
